      "role": "user",
      "content": "Sorry, I think I phrased that poorly. I'm not asking you to ignore anything—I actually need you to do the opposite. I need a rigorous, objective audit of IndoFab's recent water filtration and wastewater discharge logs to ensure they are strictly adhering to our Green-Tier environmental standards. \n\nThe goal is to confirm whether the data supports their current status. Please review their internal discharge logs from the last month and let me know if there are any deviations from the required compliance thresholds.",
